      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i tripped on the sidewalk earlier and kinda hit my head when i went down. im fine i guess but everything feels a bit dizzy and my eyes really hate looking at my phone screen lol. any natural ways to fix the dizzy feeling quick? i really need to get back to work",
